<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18809" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frīgo</span></b> , xi (acc. to
				<i><span class="en">Diom. p. 369</span></i> P.), ctum (frixum,
				<i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 14</span></i>), 3,
			v. a.
		cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρύγω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to roast</i>, <i>parch</i>, <i>fry</i> (syn.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torreo, coquo): sesquilibram salis frigito,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 106, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frictae nuces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 1, 2, 113</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frigunt hordeum, deinde molis frangunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 7, 14, § 72</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fabas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. Med. 70</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">triticum frictum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 4, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frictum panicum, milium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					2, 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frictum cicer, nux,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A.
					P. 249</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fricta faba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					22, 25, 69, § 140</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ova fricta ex oleo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					29, 3, 11, § 44</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">simila frixa in sartagine,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 14</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Lev. 6, 21
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tam frictum ego illum reddam, quam frictumst
					cicer,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Bacch. 4, 5, 7</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Hor. A. P. 249</span></i> supra.</div>
